              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "text": "Space Structure Applications"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "picture-132",
              "kind": "picture",
              "src": "https://titanium.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/space.jpg",
              "alt": "wire",
              "href": "",
              "wrap": "right"
            },
            {
              "id": "text-133",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "In addition to airframe, engine, helicopter and military applications, Titanium is also used in space structure applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "The characteristics of Titanium recognized by the Aerospace industry for the application of Titanium, are the same reasons Titanium has been used in military and space applications. Selection of Titanium in space structures is based on strength, weight, and reliability, temperature resistance and high temperature endurance."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium was used extensively in the early Mercury and Apollo programs and continues to be designed into manned spacecraft, solid rocket booster cases, guidance control pressure vessels and currently the space station is an end use for Titanium."
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 4,
                  "text": "Products used in this airframe applications include:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "To gain further insights into Titanium Industries and the diverse markets we cater to with our specialty metals, we invite you to explore our range of other markets:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Additive Manufacturing Build Plates](https://titanium.com/markets/additive-manufacturing-build-plates/) [Aerospace](https://titanium.com/markets/aerospace/) [Industrial](https://titanium.com/markets/industrial/) [Medical](https://titanium.com/markets/medical/) [Defense](https://titanium.com/markets/defense/) [Engineered Fastener Alloys](https://titanium.com/markets/engineered-fasteners/) [Consumer Products](https://titanium.com/markets/consumer-products/) [Interconnect](https://titanium.com/interconnect-alloys/)"
                },
